{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:InformationTheory.InformationBandwidth","@type":"LeanModule","name":"InformationTheory.InformationBandwidth","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Units.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.informationBandwidth_eq_factored","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.informationBandwidth_eq_factored","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/information-bandwidth.lean#L45-L54","doc":"The information bandwidth factors as c_q · n_R · η, with\nc_q = 1/(q - 1) = `↑u⁻¹` the speed of light and\nn_R = 1/ℏ_q = q/(q-1) = `q · ↑u⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.informationBandwidth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.informationBandwidth","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/information-bandwidth.lean#L34-L43","doc":"**Information bandwidth** per Planck time at substrate parameter q.\n\n𝔅(q) := q · η_q / (q - 1)²\n\nThe product of the speed of light c_q = 1/(q - 1), the iteration\ncount n_R(q) = 1/ℏ_q, and the operational entropy η_q per fibre. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:information-bandwidth","label":"def:information-bandwidth","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/information-bandwidth.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}